Package: pdr-sign
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: corne <332404964+Laymer000007@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgl1, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libwayland-client0
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | xdg-desktop-portal-gtk | xdg-desktop-portal-kde
Homepage: https://github.com/Laymer000007/pdr-sign
Description: Fast PDF reader with Fill & Sign
 PDR – Portable Document Read and Sign is a calm, fast PDF reader with
 continuous scrolling, thumbnails, outline, search, text selection and
 printing, following the desktop's light or dark theme.
 .
 Fill & Sign completes forms without leaving the reader: form fields, text,
 ticks, crosses, dots, lines and dates, plus signatures, initials and company
 stamps drawn, typed or cleaned up from a phone photo. Save keeps entries
 editable; Save signed copy writes a new file with everything locked into
 the pages.
